OL,3,GNEWSAExtra police patrols to replace
OL,4,Atowns security plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to deploy private security
OL,7,Fpatrols in towns and villages in
OL,8,FLeicestershire have been shelved after
OL,9,Fa new police plan was agreed.
OL,11,FIn May, Reform UK police and crime
OL,12,Fcommissioner (PCC) Rupert Matthews said
OL,13,Fhe was looking at spending #2m on 20 to
OL,14,F30 marshals, to provide a "visible and
OL,15,Funiformed" presence to "improve
OL,16,Fcommunity safety".
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
