OL,3,GNEWSAExtra police patrols to replace
OL,4,Atowns security plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe PCC has now confirmed that after
OL,7,F"consideration of all available
OL,8,Foptions", additional police patrols
OL,9,Fwill operate in Market Harborough,
OL,10,FHinckley, Loughborough, Coalville,
OL,11,FMelton Mowbray and Ashby-de-la-Zouch.
OL,13,FThis will use both police and police
OL,14,Fcommunity support officers (PCSOs) and
OL,15,Fcost less than the initial plans,
OL,16,Fofficials said.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
